---
/**
 * Wraps the Mentor Game Studio era (Mitko's solo-era mentor work through the
 * reunion) so it stays one group for the tag-filter cascade. The era now reads
 * purely from its cards' warm-tinted backgrounds — there's no rail — and its
 * label heads Mitko's column inside the first entry (see ApartBlock
 * `mentorLabel`).
 */
---

<div class="mentor-container">
	<div class="mentor-content">
		<slot />
	</div>
</div>

<style>
	.mentor-container {
		width: 100%;
	}

	.mentor-content {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 2rem;
	}
</style>
